1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Cherry, is there a better way I should approach this?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Yeah, I think she mainly speaks Cantonese and she always nods or says yes to anybody like nurses or physicians.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
But I don't think she wants to be touched today.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
I'm so glad I asked.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Would you like to help me wash her arms or would she prefer if I leave the basin here for you too?

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Of course I can help with... help her to wash.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Thank you.

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Because we are new here, we thought that is a nursing job.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
So it's good that I can help her.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
I think she'll be more comfortable because I'm closer to her.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:47,800
Sounds good.

12
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:52,000
Thank you.

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
OK, I will let you wash yourself, ok? [Cantonese]

14
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
OK.

15
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Thank you.

16
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:13,000
It’s very cool! [Cantonese]

17
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Would you like to wash your arms, too? [Cantonese]

18
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Ok...